<BaseLayout title="P3｜AI Platform Evolution">

<section class="page-hero">
  <div class="page-hero-inner">
    <div class="kicker">VOL.01 · P3 · AI PLATFORM EVOLUTION</div>
    <h1>四個訊號如何共同打造下一代 AI 平台？</h1>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section">
  <div class="grid">

    <article class="card reading">
      <span class="number">01</span>
      <h2>Compute Scaling</h2>
      <p>先進製程提高運算密度與能源效率。</p>
    </article>

    <article class="card reading">
      <span class="number">02</span>
      <h2>Advanced Packaging</h2>
      <p>CoWoS、SoIC、SoW 推動高密度異質整合。</p>
    </article>

    <article class="card reading">
      <span class="number">03</span>
      <h2>Optical Interconnect</h2>
      <p>高速互連逐步成為 AI 系統的重要瓶頸。</p>
    </article>

    <article class="card reading">
      <span class="number">04</span>
      <h2>Materials & Infrastructure</h2>
      <p>材料、設備、散熱與電力成為系統升級的重要支撐。</p>
    </article>

  </div>
</section>

